  "caption": "Table 5 :",
  "cells": [
   {
    "row": 0,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "Listing 1: Chain-of-Thought annotations for HotpotQA.",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": null,
    "digest": "a521927ba63946cac947a0563dad8dae75cb6e2423eb89e9717180d9c2bff923"
   },
   {
    "row": 1,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "Q: What film directed by Brian Patrick Butler was inspired by a film directed by F.W. Murnau?",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": null,
    "digest": "1bca6add30620012f385a32c193eb58314e05ad7152703df07c715cd35ec0724"
   },
   {
    "row": 2,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "A: Brian Patrick Butler directed the film The Phantom Hour. The Phantom Hour was inspired by the films such as Nosferatu",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": null,
    "digest": "76ec5380702cb15960203aeb738e9fb28ab6134293e844198534a47d9c071674"
   },
   {
    "row": 3,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "and The Cabinet of Dr. Caligari. Of these Nosferatu was directed by F.W. Murnau. So the answer is: The Phantom Hour.",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": null,
    "digest": "145ba757907d205a4a5cfaecf1b976eabd38e6646e4f58dbeb848eb50a647661"
   },
   {
    "row": 4,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "Q: How many episodes were in the South Korean television series in which Ryu Hye-young played Bo-ra?",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": null,
    "digest": "2477867aa43ba161d5d56be7b138881c1714f7d60b71128dd72e4d037c9f37fd"
   },
   {
    "row": 5,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "A: The South Korean television series in which Ryu Hye-young played Bo-ra is Reply 1988. The number of episodes Reply",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": null,
    "digest": "584237b74ea95d93affa91efdfaf2eef3981c6fb9bf03b57fb2ce88214513ef4"
   },
   {
    "row": 6,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "1988 has is 20. So the answer is: 20.",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": null,
    "digest": "a8e6cc9b53855509542418546a8a56ee4ae4293c377f343cf40ab94fca248ec0"
   },
   {
    "row": 7,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "Q: Vertical Limit stars which actor who also played astronaut Alan Shepard in \"The Right Stuff\"?",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": null,
    "digest": "08c003d918adfcd3be185d7c8f6425d337af427be9a449dabc8f8fa6beef4ec1"
   },
   {
    "row": 8,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "A: The actor who played astronaut Alan Shepard in \"The Right Stuff\" is Scott Glenn. The movie Vertical Limit also starred",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": null,
    "digest": "24ed08716eefc27def92bcccc235be10c8c12e3ded143f69aff83233c3ab18e4"
   },
   {
    "row": 9,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "Scott Glenn. So the answer is: Scott Glenn.",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": null,
    "digest": "9008d32b7c3bd99bed39353b8bdff6791e30a727a4bea79c1cf9554c30e1145c"
   },
   {
    "row": 10,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "Q: What was the 2014 population of the city where Lake Wales Medical Center is located?",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": null,
    "digest": "145d60a962c0e46287c9d7686d00b707b030952e582d9d72e9dc2199e082afd8"
   },
   {
    "row": 11,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "A: Lake Wales Medical Center is located in the city of Polk County, Florida. The population of Polk County in 2014 was",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": null,
    "digest": "7b91780195393e8f56b3efeb0e51e3c024c8ab1d4ea7de04a291ac7b650de6c0"
   },
   {
    "row": 12,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "15,140. So the answer is: 15,140.",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": null,
    "digest": "9576e5f8a8390cddd078f827e2772039f5f95554f44c8be323f3dae27155b6ea"
   },
   {
    "row": 13,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "Q: Who was born first? Jan de Bont or Raoul Walsh?",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": null,
    "digest": "adaf5905fec8a59ad0e60c6c9fbfce78e0d2d9875206eca3bd360dc3c0d0b212"
   },
   {
    "row": 14,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "A: Jan de Bont was born on 22 October 1943. Raoul Walsh was born on March 11, 1887. Thus, Raoul Walsh was born the",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": null,
    "digest": "809eaf9c5886b1e94162269d20aa12a3bade6eb2520dd17f5f69f257202bfd1c"
   },
   {
    "row": 15,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "first. So the answer is: Raoul Walsh.",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": null,
    "digest": "098b9a468f56c7c44fbb823a045dd3c4116f242443114d23d37e7269506e07be"
   },
   {
    "row": 16,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "Q: In what country was Lost Gravity manufactured?",
    "coordinates": null,
    "span": null,
    "digest": "2286b9057efeb4459078d552a40ef953cf4ed09137aba5eb2c7cda854e6a8610"
   },
   {
    "row": 17,
    "column": 0,
    "colspan": 1,
    "rowspan": 1,
    "text": "A: The Lost Gravity (roller coaster) was manufactured by Mack Rides. Mack Rides is a German company. So the answer is:",
